<div class="container-fluid">
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <div class="updated-date">Last updated: January 2026</div>

        <p>
            Welcome to <strong>ShriAiTech</strong> (<a href="https://shriaitech.in" target="_blank">https://shriaitech.in</a>).
            We value your trust and are committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains
            how we collect, use, store, and safeguard your information when you visit our website or use our services.
        </p>

        <p>
            By accessing or using our website, you agree to the terms outlined in this Privacy Policy.
        </p>

        <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>

        <h3>a) Personal & Business Information</h3>
        <p>When you contact us, request a quote, or use our services, we may collect:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Name</li>
            <li>Email address</li>
            <li>Phone number</li>
            <li>Company or organization name</li>
            <li>Project requirements or technical details</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>b) Automatically Collected Information</h3>
        <p>When you visit our website, we may automatically collect:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>IP address</li>
            <li>Browser type and device information</li>
            <li>Operating system</li>
            <li>Pages visited and time spent on the site</li>
            <li>Referring URLs</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p>Your information is used to:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Respond to inquiries and support requests</li>
            <li>Provide software development, IT, and consulting services</li>
            <li>Prepare proposals, estimates, and contracts</li>
            <li>Improve our website, products, and services</li>
            <li>Send service-related updates and communications</li>
            <li>Comply with legal and regulatory obligations</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>3. Cookies and Tracking Technologies</h2>
        <p>
            ShriAiTech uses cookies and similar technologies to analyze traffic, enhance functionality,
            and improve user experience. You can disable cookies through your browser settings,
            though some features may not function properly.
        </p>

        <h2>4. Data Sharing and Disclosure</h2>
        <p>
            We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal or business information to third parties.
        </p>
        <p>
            Information may be shared only with trusted partners, employees, or service providers
            strictly for project execution or operational purposes, or when required by law.
        </p>

        <h2>5. Data Security</h2>
        <p>
            We implement appropriate technical and organizational measures to protect your data
            from unauthorized access, loss, or misuse. However, no online system can guarantee
            complete security.
        </p>

        <h2>6. Confidentiality of Client Data</h2>
        <p>
            Any project-related data, source code, credentials, or business information shared
            with ShriAiTech is treated as confidential and used only for agreed service purposes.
        </p>

        <h2>7. Third-Party Links</h2>
        <p>
            Our website may include links to third-party websites or tools. ShriAiTech is not
            responsible for the privacy practices or content of such external sites.
        </p>

        <h2>8. Your Rights</h2>
        <p>You have the right to:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Access your personal information</li>
            <li>Request corrections or updates</li>
            <li>Request deletion of your data (subject to legal obligations)</li>
            <li>Opt out of non-essential communications</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>9. Children’s Privacy</h2>
        <p>
            ShriAiTech does not knowingly collect personal information from individuals under the age of 18.
        </p>

        <h2>10. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
        <p>
            We may update this Privacy Policy periodically. Any changes will be posted on this page
            with a revised update date.
        </p>
